  "notes": [
    "**Verse F♮** is the Mixolydian colour — play F, not F#. Root 8ths, slightly muted.",
    "**Chorus** is where the bass drives: Bm–C–G with the C landing on beat 3. Open it right up.",
    "**Bridge:** C–Em–C–G, half-time feel in the drums; keep 8ths steady underneath, build into the instrumental."
  ],
